Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.84,0:00:09.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}1234 5678
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.75,0:00:12.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}2234 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:12.35,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.02,0:00:15.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！这才开始呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:23.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,1234 5678
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs50}《详解 保育员资格考试题库》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:25.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:26.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们翻越了堆积如山的工作 终于能休假了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.59,0:00:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！好像快点见到你！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.97,0:00:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那软绵绵的 像棉花糖一样的白云 真白啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:45.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 别再说了 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:49.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我都说过了 已经不是小孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是啊 抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 不管你长多大 永远都是我可爱的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:01:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 好想快点见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.61,0:01:03.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（拉炮声）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:06.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:09.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜悦的声音 我们在外面都听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.93,0:01:11.14,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:12.99,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:15.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,令尊令母 什么时候回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:20.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,后天 我准备去桃空机场去接他们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:23.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,机场？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:28.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 就是上次送遇到麻烦的阿婆去的那个地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:30.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.65,0:01:31.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,机场啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:34.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我早想去一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:37.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是能够看到飞机起飞的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:41.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我还记得桃空机场的餐饮区
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:44.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,有烧鲷鱼... 啊 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.55,0:01:46.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是有鲷鱼烧店的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.86,0:01:50.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 而且还是飞机造型的鲷鱼烧哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:51.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:53.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那就一定要去吃一次了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:58.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那么坐我的车 大伙一起去机场？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:04.60,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,还能给小白的爸爸妈妈一个惊喜 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:06.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:08.45,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,去机场！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}起飞！由飞机相系的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.57,0:03:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\frz356.6\pos(396,561)}{\3a&HFF&\4c&H9367B4&}桃空机场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乘客们 久等了 将于10点35分起飞的第MM...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:03:59.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:00.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是机场！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:02.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:04.74,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,机场 到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:06.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:06.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:08.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那几位着装整齐的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:15.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是驾驶飞机的飞行员和为空中旅途护航的空乘小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.34,0:04:19.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:23.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,离小白爸爸妈妈的航班抵达 还有一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们随便逛逛吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.65,0:04:26.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\fs50}用料讲究的水果蜜瓜包
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\fs50}在本店消费 可以攒积分！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}桃空饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,机场真好玩啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.67,0:04:51.52,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,机场 喜欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:53.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主也很喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:55.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,接着去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:59.33,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,去少年最期待的地方吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,641)}瞭望台
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:01.62,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你是指...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.46,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,灰机！飞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:18.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,机场嘛 还得来看飞机！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:23.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！我一直渴望飞上蓝天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:26.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,学习了航空力学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:29.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,即使现在梦想已经实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:34.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞机依旧是我的向往
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:38.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:41.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还真的很不可思议呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:45.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那么大的东西 连翅膀都不扇 居然就能飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:49.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 这到底是怎么一回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 这样的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:53.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:55.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 交接棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:05:59.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我来说明！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:03.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟是通过扇动翅膀 来承接风
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:07.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞机则是通过喷射引擎等 来加速
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:11.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,利用承接到的风力来进行飞行！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.69,0:06:12.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:15.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喷射腌青菜！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:15.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1000,970)}胡萝卜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:17.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,飞天蔬菜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.59,0:06:18.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.35,0:06:22.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟和飞机都是靠翅膀来承接风力进行飞行的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:25.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,描述这种力的专用术语
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,升力！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:30.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没错！你居然知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:32.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是基础中的基础 虽然肉眼看不到风
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧 乘着风飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:49.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,风对飞行是至关重要的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:53.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.51,0:06:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.57,0:06:57.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非你也对飞机很有兴趣？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:06:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也挺懂的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起用望远镜看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:03.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:05.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是意气相投？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:08.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 很开心呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:09.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:11.33,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也要看！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:19.30,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看的好远啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:22.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,反了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:23.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:25.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要从这边看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫天野翔子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔子有着 飞上高空的女孩 这样一层意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很棒吧 你叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:44.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:45.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:49.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,夕凪... 夕凪翼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:49.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1035,975)}夕无风
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 你也有个很棒的名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.03,0:07:54.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:56.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:58.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,夕无风？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:01.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,取个全名 在生活中会更方便吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:04.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,前一阵 我跟少年一起琢磨出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:06.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:08.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,很适合阿翼的名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:09.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,适合！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:14.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,翔子真的很喜欢飞机呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我的梦想是要像妈妈一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为一名飞行员
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:22.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:25.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,稍 稍微等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:30.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,翔子你是说 你的妈妈是飞行员吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:35.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害！太厉害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天啊 是我第一次坐妈妈驾驶的飞机的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:41.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:43.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定很期待吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:51.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 说起来你一个人 没别的大人了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 爸爸的话 现在正在办理登机手续
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫我在旁边等一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？对了 明明叫我等着的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:13.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,登机手续是在...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:14.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一楼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸现在肯定很担心吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜... 怎么办...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:25.31,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不要哭 我们一起去找爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:28.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能找到爸爸吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:33.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！肯定能找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:37.31,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,而且爸爸肯定也在找翔子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:38.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我估计...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（广播铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}现在有一则儿童走失通知
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:47.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天野翔子小妹妹 你爸爸正在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}请至前台 或者询问就近的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:50.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:55.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我来背你吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:10:01.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看我用喷射腌青菜的速度 送你到爸爸那里去！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.31,0:10:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 不是喷射腌青菜 是喷射引擎...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,前台是在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:13.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙一起去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:16.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 翔子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}总服务台
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该在能看到爸爸的地方等着的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 爸爸也没有牢牢看着你 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:40.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢各位
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱人... 不 翔子的妈妈是一位民航飞行员
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整天开着飞机到处跑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么时候陪我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.72,0:11:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她应该也有想妈妈的时候 却从来没有表露出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.81,0:11:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直在为妈妈加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她期待着有一天能跟妈妈一起飞...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:10.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:16.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为太期待 就一个人跑到了能够看到飞机的地方吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:19.16,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.71,0:11:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你们飞行无忧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:24.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我们该去登机了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家！再见！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:32.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一路顺风！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:34.63,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,爱爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:37.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞机就是棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:40.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不仅仅是带着乘客们飞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:43.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,还能联系起乘坐的人们的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:46.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年 这话说得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:49.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不...不 我随便说说的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:51.67,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,这话说得好！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,连公主都...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:57.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学 我们也该去接你的父母了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（广播铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}现在有一则儿童走失通知
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:05.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,还有别的走失儿童
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好担心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}Precure小妹妹 Precure小妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:10.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}弥诺彤先生正在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}请至屋顶的展望台
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:18.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,弥诺彤 是上次出现的...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:21.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,只会令人有讨厌的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:23.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 不能放任他不管！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.34,0:12:24.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:30.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊 Precure 快点来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好热！那个人真不怕热呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快点去室内吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.31,0:12:40.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,说不热 那是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:44.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,即使吾是一位自负的武人 热就还是热啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:48.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 吾有这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:53.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:55.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这风 能用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:56.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,弥诺彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:59.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,把我们叫到这里来 想要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,做这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:05.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:15.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:20.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们来这里的目的 是因为畏惧吾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:24.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,想要坐飞机远走高飞吧 这可不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:40.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:41.84,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（广播铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}乘客们 你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}因为突发的强气流 全部航班将有延迟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈的飞机... 不能飞了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎... 怎么会的...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:02.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:06.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这下 你们无法逃脱吾的掌心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:21.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这下 你们无法逃脱吾的掌心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.49,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你瞎说什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:28.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会逃 也不会躲！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:31.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像是那种自说自话的类型呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.37,0:14:35.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,翔子期盼着坐妈妈的飞机的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:38.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学也很期待和父母团聚...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:42.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上吧！公主去安全的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:43.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:43.25,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
