Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:41.24,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:43.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是放弃逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:47.62,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来一决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:51.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:54.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.49,0:16:57.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:01.43,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.68,0:17:04.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事！只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:08.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,上空的风太强了 我没法飞上去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:09.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:11.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:16.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂... 你是不是把我们给忘了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.05,0:17:19.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:21.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:22.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:24.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这里这里！我也在哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.49,0:17:27.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,低空飞行没问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:32.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦？乱暴？啦啦啦...啦啦啦...啦...乱暴？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.97,0:17:35.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有破绽！看拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:37.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.70,0:17:39.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,棋逢敌手 敬佩敬佩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:42.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那就只能提高力量打服他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.66,0:17:50.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.84,0:17:52.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:53.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:17:54.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:55.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:56.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:02.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:07.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 如何啊 体会到吾乱暴兽的强力了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:10.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,动手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:12.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:17.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:20.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不错 那么这一招呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.15,0:18:22.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:27.98,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.15,0:18:28.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.69,0:18:30.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:34.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这是... 居然会有这么紊乱的湍流？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:39.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,被这种风刮到的话 飞机是绝对飞不起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:42.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去 翔子...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.53,0:18:46.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我来打倒它！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:51.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 要怎么在这湍流中飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.10,0:18:54.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,至少 能够判断出风的流向...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:58.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,风的... 流向？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.47,0:19:04.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,对了！Prism！朝上空发射棱镜光流！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:06.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing 你想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:09.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,回想一下翔子说过的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:12.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,想要判断看不见的风的流向...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.43,0:19:16.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？啊！肥皂泡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:18.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:23.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到风了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:29.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 不要让他靠近！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.64,0:19:30.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:33.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 机会来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:43.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,双色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:44.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:44.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:47.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:47.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:53.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,速度的力量 飞扬起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.32,0:19:57.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:57.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.11,0:19:59.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,冲呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:00.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:01.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:04.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄气阔！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:07.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞翼冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:07.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wing Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:13.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.59,0:20:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:27.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,胜败乃兵家常事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:29.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,下次可不会这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:31.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弥诺彤彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.18,0:20:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乘客们 久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本机即将起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.25,0:20:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请尽享飞行的乐趣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是妈妈的声音！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说要出发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔子 我们起飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:59.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一路顺风 翔子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.43,0:21:01.18,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,一路顺风！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.45,0:21:05.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这样真白爸妈的飞机也能着陆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:09.23,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,就要感动的相聚了 紧张吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:11.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎...怎么会 太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:14.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊 的确有点激动呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.31,0:21:19.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好想把大伙介绍给爸爸和妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:20.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:20.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an1}小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.84,0:21:21.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}我{\3c&H8664F7&}爱{\r}真白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市 购物中心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.16,0:21:46.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,快乐的时间就一转眼的工夫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:49.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸和妈妈又出国工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.65,0:21:54.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上次送他们的时候 心里很难受的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.74,0:21:57.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我身边有大伙在！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.29,0:21:59.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:02.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一路顺风！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:09.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Peach哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:09.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1050,975)}桃子愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.60,0:22:12.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起 把握幸福！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.60,0:22:12.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1005,975)}get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.29,0:23:47.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.08,0:23:49.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.41,0:23:51.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是在幻镜平板里面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:53.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好像没办法很轻松地就出去...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.85,0:23:56.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好 大伙一起来通关
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.66,0:23:57.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.29,0:24:02.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,用幻镜平板来一场 兴奋不已大训练!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:11.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:17.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:22.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:30.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:35.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:39.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:41.20,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:45.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:50.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:52.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:56.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:03:00.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.61,0:03:03.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:03.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.97,0:03:06.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:06.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:11.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:16.40,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.65,0:03:21.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:26.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.37,0:03:37.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
